    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I joined in a most absurd competition.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, that was absurd indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I intended to seek history, honor the feats of heroes past, be steadfast in my pursuit of victory, and confront fate itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, confronting fate and... the other thing. Basically, your ten old silver medals are a single shiny new one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't worry. This is Sargon, after all, so that's no failure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Golden sands above, gold itself below.' As the lords ameer and padishahs say, sand can be as precious as gold.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't sweat it. Maybe you'll go down some windy road, you'll find yourself recognized, and that golden cup will be handed right over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Handed over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's say, maybe you were to chat with the lucky winner of the cup, and wheedle your way into his trust...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014You're right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The treasure I put forth was recognized. This means that Minoan culture itself was also recognized.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if the assessment of the judges was strikingly superficial, the scoring of the silver medals and my position are sufficient proof that even Sargonian historians hold a basic respect for Minos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should have words with the collector of the goblet. If he were to understand the deep history behind it, perhaps he would be willing to sell it back to me at a price I can afford.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You call <i>that</i> recognition?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, if it's enough to cheer you up, I guess we'll call that a victory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you very much, Narantuya. You are too kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like the wise men debating around the white columns, you have awoken me. I will not lose the honor that those silver medals represented. In fact, I have now won even more in turn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The trick played upon me by fate is unworthy of notice, by comparison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moreover, if immersing those medals in the water would aid the people to see what they wish to see, then I am happy to serve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1477_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If throwing this gem into the river would summon the god I've heard so much talk of, then I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aspasia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "WAIT!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can see you're feeling a bit better, but calm down. Don't throw it away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a plan... Or I guess, I have a person I wish to see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't really care about the gem, could I... borrow it for a while?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
