        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The traps are ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ajani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, I was real careful putting them together. The more someone knows, the less they'll suspect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ajani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1485_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1484_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also slipped the invitation into the girl's bag. I made sure to wear gloves for handling artifacts, no way I left any fingerprints behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ajazi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nice work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll handle the back end of our plan. Any questions from you two?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1485_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1484_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have one! I don't understand why the Padishah's daughter would fall for our bait?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ajazi"
    },
    {
        "text": "This gem doesn't seem that special. It's got lots of impurities, like the stone Ajani and I pulled up from the sewer the other day...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ajazi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4138_narant_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about what the rich folk think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch the door tonight. Keep your eyes peeled. Don't let her send anyone over to take it before the time is right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Narantuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1485_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1484_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, okay... We won't let you down this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ajazi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1485_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right! We won't let anyone in!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ajani"
    },
