        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "An anonymous letter, alongside an indistinct photo of the gem. The letter specifies a time and place for you to be, alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "text": "An incredibly obvious trap. You should not go, Pepe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I have to go. How else am I supposed to get the gem?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You agreed to take me to the man-made lake in the city tonight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I say that? Or maybe you misremembered and it's actually tomorrow night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since my brain was replaced, I have not misremembered a single thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's true, you would have remembered where all the gems were.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You could ask Anat. She wrote a loooooot of official-looking documents about you lately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also have a few observational reports and paragraphs of a draft for a paper on this ancient general, actually.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe she can take you there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I might need to take a few more shifts, if so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really have no idea who sent this letter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The tourist who got second place seemed like a nice lady.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I might have been too easy to read at the Harvest Gathering. Everyone could probably tell I wanted the gem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we need it to get more information out of Zubayr. Whether it's info on my hidden treasure or data for your thesis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even so, I advise you not to take the risk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if I've been across all of Sargon by now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do recall you nearly failing to make it back twice when we were still in school. Good thing Titi and I decided to look for you both times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yeah. You recruited a team of adventurers on burdenbeasts to find me, all so I could judge which of the two of you translated some ancient document more accurately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Titi was here, I might have some backing on going to the meet-up spot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing she isn't here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She's not? Where is she, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "53_g2_menatmainstreet_n",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Cause inconvenience'... She said that like I was out to mess things up for her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* I helped her out with all the documents before. She wouldn't faint from all the pressure at the office, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 5,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_grass",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014! Wh-What was that noise?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're my cute little jewel construct, then come out like a good kid. No need to freak me out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to count to three. If you're not out by then, I'm going to use my Arts on you. You've been warned.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "One, two... three!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_magic_2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "afrom": 0.15,
        "rfrom": 255,
        "gfrom": 255,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "power": 20,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_meowlong",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Meow\u2014!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, darn it! It's you again, little cloudbeast!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-150,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "50,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#8$1",
        "posfrom": "150,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, buddy. Do forgive me. *sigh* Alright, here, some pats on the head, please don't get mad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're a bit of a bad-tempered scratcher, but let me explain! I've got a good reason for being a bit jittery today!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_meowshort",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meow...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you still remember when we were all at the museum earlier? I got freaked out by a bunch of things suddenly jumping all over the place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...And then, today, I got in another fight with Anat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, please, please don't be as mad at me as her, you cute little cloudbeast you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_catgrunting",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1482_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Purring)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know, we're always getting into fights\u2014over academic matters, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know that she really wants to publish her research for everyone to see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "I also know that it's not easy to get the opportunity to hold a special exhibit like this, so she's being real cautious, and also kinda overstressed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "So stressed that in the end, she didn't dare press on with her original goal.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's obvious I'm trying to make sure she doesn't give up on the special exhibit, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_catgrunting"
    },
    {
        "text": "Medjehtiqedti unconsciously speeds up her cloudbeast petting."
    },
    {
        "text": "As she does, Mio purrs louder and louder."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the girl pays no heed. She is lost in her thoughts, petting and petting and petting and petting..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She used to be real quiet in the past. Whenever she was nervous, her arms and legs would flail about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whenever she'd have to give a speech, everyone would be snickering at her by the end of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even if her voice was overpowered by the laughter, she would persevere and finish her speech.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* If only I could just rub her ears to give her the courage to persevere in other things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Medjehtiqedti cups the cloudbeast's face in her hands and rubs it vigorously as she vents her feelings, without the slightest bit of interest in why the cloudbeast is purring so loudly."
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, she feels a warmth in the palm of her hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoa! Was that a hairball?! Don't spit it on my sleeve!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Eh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "A jewel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_deluxeroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#4$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I could go to the meet-up spot alone, but with a monitoring device hidden on me. We could get some private security to lie in ambush nearby.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's far too last-minute for that, Pepe. Security companies won't have the manpower on the eve of the Flood Festival, not to mention you can't negotiate with them in the middle of the night.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... How about renting an aircraft to support me if needed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such a flying object would be rather suspicious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#11$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could smash the door in with my hammer, give them a good fright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That <i>does</i> seem like it could work...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...But would that not be damaging a historical building?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* I guess that would be a debatable too. Though I'm not sure any building is anywhere near as historical as you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am rather fond of what the people who came after me have left behind\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#10$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Good! Evening! Everyoneeeeeee!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? You're here too, Pepe? Perfect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you all guess what I just ran into on the road earlier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good timing, Titi! We've been discussing something really important, and I need your support here\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick, help me make Pepe see sense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "If this was an opportunity to excavate an important historical site, would you just give up because you were in a bit of danger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You of all should know that an excavation requires patience! You're just eager to prove yourself against your brother right now! This is all just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#12$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, you're <i>really</i> not pulling any punches this time around, Anat...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh* Nobody going to take a guess?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your clothes are covered in fur.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for indulging me, Zubayr Effendi. Correct, I ran into a little cloudbeast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1479_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In my age, the people believed that cloudbeasts were bringers of good fortune.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zubayr"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It turns out that in this age, I'm a believer too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It spit out a gemstone full of luck for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4139_papyrs_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Anat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "effect",
        "name": "$e_emoji_proud",
        "layer": 1,
        "x": 40,
        "y": 170
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A what?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$newhope01_intro",
        "key": "$newhope01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#11$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see, please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anat says you agreed to invest in a new exhibition hall in return for her lending you a gem out of the museum collection.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4058_pepe_1#6$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I hear you, I'll make an investment in your name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pepe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Pepe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you... No, all of you will agree with me on something else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pepe, Anat and... Zubayr Effendi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1478_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think this jewel can grant our wishes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medjehtiqedti"
    },
